Core/Jessie: How long do you think this’ll last? The Bloom?
Core/Rose: I don’t know. Without a coordinated response, without infrastructure…
Core/Rose: It could be years. Decades. Or it could burn itself out.
Core/Jessie: That’s not exactly comforting.
Core/Rose: I’m not going to lie to you, Jessie. I don’t have answers.
Core/Jessie: I appreciate the honesty.
Core/Rose: It’s all I have left.